# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit real values.
#
# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID (type: Web application) used by the Google Photos Picker import.
# Leave empty to build without Google Photos (the UI shows "Google Photos not configured").
# A Client ID is NOT a secret (it ships in the JS bundle), but keep it out of git anyway and
# supply it in CI through the repository variable VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Base path for the production build (GitHub Pages project site). Defaults to /spendy-project/
# for `npm run build`; use "/" for previews served at the domain root.
# VITE_BASE=/spendy-project/
